  - Shows: Creating a ChatAgent with MemoryToolkit for memory management via function calling tools
  - Demonstrates saving, clearing, and loading memory using toolkit tools

- examples/agents/single_agent.py
  - Shows: Basic ChatAgent usage example (no memory tools shown here, but useful for agent setup reference)

## Implementation
- camel/memories/agent_memories.py
  - Classes: ChatHistoryMemory, VectorDBMemory, LongtermAgentMemory
  - Implements different memory types for agents with detailed methods for retrieval, writing, clearing, and managing memory records

- camel/memories/__init__.py
  - Exports: ChatHistoryMemory, LongtermAgentMemory, VectorDBMemory, AgentMemory base classes, and context creators

- camel/toolkits/memory_toolkit.py
  - Class: MemoryToolkit
  - Provides function tools for saving, loading, and clearing ChatAgent memory
  - Integrates with ChatAgent to expose memory management as callable tools

